WEBVTT

00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:01.910
<i>A.D. 2133: Peace and order were
disrupted by conventional warfare.</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.370
<i>Half of humanity was wiped out,</i>

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:14.550
<i>and many who had been wounded  in the war were revived as cyborgs.</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.720
<i>2135: In conjunction with the establishment of a cease-fire</i>

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:23.510
<i>the neutral city Olympus was founded,</i>

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:26.680
<i>and would later assume a role of arbitration in global disputes.</i>

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.770
<i>Harmony and order in the world...</i>

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:34.020
<i>Humans cohabit Olympus along with cyborgs</i>

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:40.400
<i>and bioroids: a third race created from the human genome,</i>

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.370
<i>but with certain emotions like anger and hate suppressed.</i>

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:12.480
Armed criminals have kidnapped

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:15.060
some high-ranking E.U. officials.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.230
They're barricaded in an abandoned cathedral.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.570
Motives and demands are unknown,

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:22.990
as well as the number and makeup of the group.

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:26.870
The local police can't handle it.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.660
Combat cyborgs could also be involved.

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:35.040
We move in at 22:45 sharp.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.550
Synchronize your watches to 22:30.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:41.300
3...

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.170
2...

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:43.260
1...

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:43.840
Now!

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:51.640
Cutting-edge cyborg plus analog watch... Now there's an odd combination!

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:54.850
Its heart beats just like mine.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.520
The sound will get you shot.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:59.110
You tell him, Deunan! He's your partner, right?

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:07.620
Oh, for cryin' out loud!
You two are meant for each other!

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.310
Approaching target. Drop point confirmed.

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:41.780
Drop point clear. All units, go!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.260
Deploy quickly! No time to lose!

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:41.060
I'm at the outside corridor. I'm going in now.

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:13.350
30 seconds until we go in. Everything's ready.

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.540
Flash bomb confirmed inside the cathedral!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.740
Damn that Deunan...

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.100
Move in now! On a three-count:

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:39.000
3... 2... 1!

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:46.110
Go! Run!

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.460
Right, clear!

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:48.320
There're more above!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.860
Secure the hostage!

00:05:58.910 --> 00:05:59.910
Above us!

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.060
Are you all right?

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:08.690
Take care of the hostages!

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:09.650
Got it!

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.140
They're all cyborgs! What's going on?

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:26.650
You'll have to ask them!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.500
I think that should do it.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:56.550
What are you after?

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:59.450
Do you hear me? Answer!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:02.560
All will... be... one...

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:05.230
I am Hal... con...

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.380
Damn! He's gonna self-destruct!

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.800
Are you all right, Deunan?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:43.700
Briareos?

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:48.140
Briareos!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:49.980
Wait, Deunan!

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.610
Let go! Let go, Aeacus!

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:54.900
Briareos!

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:57.490
Briareos!!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.960
A construction Landmate is on the rampage in Sector B-47.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.880
A request has been put in to dispatch ES.W.A.T.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.960
Team 2, head to the WASP hangar

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:37.710
in Delta formation immediately.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:38.590
Repeat:

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:42.260
A construction Landmate is on the rampage in Sector B-47.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.220
A request has been put in to dispatch ES.W.A.T.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:46.100
Team 2, head to the WASP...

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.770
<i>Commander Lance.</i>

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.020
<i>Is this Deunan?</i>

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:52.630
I heard the dispatch.
I'm actually right near B-47 now.

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:54.270
Aren't you off-duty today?

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:59.280
Looks like I'm already here.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:07.510
We'll be there soon.
Don't do anything reckless, Deunan.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.590
This is nuts!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:15.670
Get out!

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.670
What's all the racket?

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.220
That son of a bitch...

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:23.010
He started going ballistic in the Landmate because he got fired!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.760
Look out!

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.180
Come on, run! This way!

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:48.490
Get up!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.130
Where's the stop switch?

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.130
On his back.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:05.140
Taking off now.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.850
They all treat me like shit!

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:21.110
Goddamn it!

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:24.130
Take this!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.080
You're late!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.040
Shit!

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:41.460
Now?! I know!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.650
You lousy bitch!

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:51.830
Shit!

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.040
Get off me, damn it!

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.170
Shit!

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:12.330
Dammit! It's not moving!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:15.560
What are you going to do? Let me out of here!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:21.460
We showed up for nothing, huh?
You overdid it!

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:23.730
So where is the suspect?

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:25.490
He's stuck over there.

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:28.030
That a new guy?

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:31.970
Oh, right... Let me introduce you.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.390
You can do that tomorrow. See you at headquarters.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:50.280
His name is Tereus.

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:53.430
He'll be your new partner.

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:02.540
What's the meaning of this, Administrator Nike?

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:05.440
Watch your mouth, Deunan!

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:09.050
Briareos is still in critical condition!

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.300
Why at a time like this?!

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:12.300
I already told you.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:16.830
Tereus has the fighting potential to fill the opening left by Briareos.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:19.040
That's not what I'm asking!

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:26.820
Why did we assign a bioroid with Briareos' old human face?

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:30.850
That's what you're wondering, right?

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.180
Come with me, Deunan.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:56.470
As you know, we bioroids are created from human DNA,

00:13:56.470 --> 00:14:00.770
designed for a certain goal.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:07.360
Unlike humans, bioroid emotions are suppressed.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:12.320
The reason why the crime rate is so low in Olympus

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:16.370
is because we serve to mitigate conflict in human society.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:23.540
However, there is still no end to conflict in the world.

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:27.750
We have therefore decided to produce bioroids

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:30.300
with high combat capabilities to uphold public order.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:34.760
Tereus serves as our test case.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:39.600
He fights for law and order.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:43.940
Unlike humans, anger and hatred will not drive him to fight.

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:54.490
The majority of his genetic code is taken from Briareos.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.990
Why Briareos?

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:01.370
After comparing the combat data of all ES.W.A.T. members,

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:04.640
we found him to be the most qualified.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:12.170
And only he has been able to adapt to the Hechatonchires machine body.

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:16.510
His physical and mental strength are truly remarkable.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.850
You were formerly Briareos' partner,

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:26.520
which is precisely why we want <i>you</i> to assess Tereus' capabilities.

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.810
I can't agree to that!

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:30.150
This matter cannot be negotiated.

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:44.460
Deunan!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.210
Hitomi!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.380
I just got back from overseas.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:51.920
I heard about Briareos.

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:57.180
Yes?

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.470
<i>Deunan, Briareos has come to.</i>

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:02.810
What? Really?!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:08.650
The plan for the global security network that we advocate

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.980
unites the world's observation and communication satellites

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:14.530
under Olympus' control,

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:18.030
This will enhance our capacity to
monitor synchronized terrorist acts.

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:37.380
Say, what's that?

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.430
Hm?

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.930
Always behind the latest
trends aren't you, Deunan?

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:45.890
Come on, don't give me that.

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:47.350
It's one of these.

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.940
A Connexus; a multi-media terminal

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:54.690
that lets you access the network directly with your brain waves.

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:55.610
Try it on.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:01.490
I guess they're like the next generation of mobile terminals.

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:06.370
No one knows who originally built them,

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:10.170
but anyone can make a copy using open-source code available online.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.500
These things are a huge hit all over the world.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:14.300
I see...

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.880
Open the message on the right.

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:17.880
What is it?

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.010
Birthday party?

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.470
You have to come, okay?

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.480
So how old are you, Hitomi?

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.100
That's a secret!

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:33.820
Never ask a bioroid her age.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:39.900
Briareos!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:44.620
Whoa, hold it right there! No hugging, all right?

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.950
You'd end up breaking him to bits again

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:48.160
after they just finished putting him back together.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.620
Go.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.540
At this rate, he'll be out of here in about a week.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.050
Really?

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:57.300
Briareos is lucky.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:00.760
Dr. Kestner is the head professor of the Olympus Science Academy,

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.640
and an expert on cyborg medicine. Your buddy's in good hands!

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:05.970
He's also <i>my primary care physician!</i>

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:08.890
So much flattery...

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.310
Well, if you'll excuse me.

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.690
What's new with the investigation?

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:23.910
The terrorists were all cyborgs, like we thought.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.410
After re-examining the five recent terrorist incidents,

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:30.210
we learned that four had been carried out by cyborgs.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.120
Terrorist acts carried out by cyborgs...

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:33.420
What are they after?

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:36.130
It's still unclear.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.420
But we do have some clues.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:41.050
We confirmed abnormal radio waves in the surrounding areas.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:44.220
Their patterns closely resembled a brain-washing virus program

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.390
developed back during the war.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.350
You mean they were being controlled?

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.850
It's one possibility.

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:54.100
Lots of cyborgs out there have
poorly-protected parts, unlike us.

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:57.610
If someone's plotting terrorist acts using those cyborgs...

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.610
It's a vexing matter.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:05.620
We have no idea who we're
dealing with or what they want.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.120
You can't afford to be lying around like this, Bri!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:10.290
Don't be ridiculous.
I can't be out there in this condition!

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:13.080
So when do these cords come off?

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:14.580
Don't pull on that, you idiot!

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:14.580
C'mon, tell me!

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.250
Hey, Deunan, give it a rest!

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.920
There they go again.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.060
I fixed this for you.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.400
It's tougher than me, huh?

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:41.280
So have you heard about that guy named Tereus?

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:44.110
Yeah, before you came.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:47.450
Whoever they assign to me,

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:49.830
remember that you're one of
a kind as far as I'm concerned.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:39.170
Go back, Deunan!

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:02.820
Deunan! Are you all right?

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.480
Briareos...

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.490
I'm... alive, right?

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:11.990
Yeah, you're alive.

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:16.410
Thank you.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:23.000
I'll protect you, even if the world comes to an end.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:24.590
Briareos...

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:20.270
I am Yoshino, special representative from Poseidon.

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:23.610
I am Nike, Administrator of Olympus.

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:26.230
Prime Minister Athena is waiting.

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:30.700
As you see, most cyborgs that were involved in the terrorist plot

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:33.780
were using parts made in Poseidon.

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:39.660
What is your take on this, Representative Yoshino?

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:43.290
We traced the cyborg parts in question by serial number

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:46.920
to the lab that shipped them out and shut it down immediately.

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:51.300
Other departments have enacted countermeasures as well.

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:56.180
However, it would be most regrettable for you to draw further connections

00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:57.970
between the terrorists and Poseidon.

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:01.350
Then you mean to say that Poseidon has absolutely nothing to do

00:23:01.350 --> 00:23:03.350
with this latest terrorist act?

00:23:04.060 --> 00:23:08.270
As you know, Poseidon is the world's largest industrial conglomerate.

00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:13.820
Most of its profits come from trade with other countries.

00:23:13.820 --> 00:23:16.950
Siding with terrorists would
bring us no profit whatsoever.

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:21.660
If Olympus were to boycott products made in Poseidon,

00:23:21.660 --> 00:23:24.000
other countries would likely follow suit.

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:26.210
A devastating blow to our business.

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:30.510
We have issued the same message

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:33.680
to all businesses that may have been involved in the incident.

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:37.050
We cannot give Poseidon special consideration.

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:40.930
I believe one topic at the upcoming international conference

00:23:40.930 --> 00:23:43.350
is the matter of Olympus
managing the satellite systems

00:23:43.350 --> 00:23:46.690
and enhancing their surveillance capabilities, correct?

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:59.990
This contains a program to control Poseidon's satellite network.

00:23:59.990 --> 00:24:02.000
Please feel free to use it.

00:24:04.120 --> 00:24:05.420
Cutting a deal?

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:07.750
Consider it as a contribution to global welfare.

00:24:08.330 --> 00:24:12.130
I wouldn't expect to hear that from a business selling tools for war.

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:14.130
Then I ask you:

00:24:14.130 --> 00:24:16.300
What is the purpose of the Olympus' military force?

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:19.800
Do you believe you can protect the world without force?

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:30.230
That will have to be discussed at another time.

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:34.530
We'll be looking forward to a favorable reply.

00:24:57.010 --> 00:24:58.470
Oh, thanks.

00:25:04.140 --> 00:25:05.100
Happy birthday!

00:25:05.100 --> 00:25:06.430
Happy birthday, Hitomi!

00:25:06.430 --> 00:25:07.770
Happy birthday!

00:25:10.350 --> 00:25:14.860
I'd like to thank you all so much for coming tonight.

00:25:15.440 --> 00:25:17.490
Please enjoy the party!

00:25:20.490 --> 00:25:22.620
Happy birthday, Hitomi.

00:25:22.620 --> 00:25:24.290
Thank you, Yoshitsune.

00:25:26.580 --> 00:25:29.790
Who is that hiding over there?

00:25:31.290 --> 00:25:34.840
Come on, get over here!

00:25:42.010 --> 00:25:43.260
I didn't even recognize you!

00:25:43.260 --> 00:25:44.470
What a surprise!

00:25:44.470 --> 00:25:45.010
Hey, now.

00:25:50.650 --> 00:25:52.150
Well, well...

00:25:54.150 --> 00:25:56.860
Okay, enough already!

00:25:58.820 --> 00:26:00.030
Happy birthday, Hitomi!

00:26:00.030 --> 00:26:01.280
Oh, thanks!

00:26:01.280 --> 00:26:03.040
Happy birthday, Hitomi.

00:26:04.830 --> 00:26:07.330
There are good things in store tonight for you, too!

00:26:08.230 --> 00:26:09.380
Look over there.

00:26:09.960 --> 00:26:10.920
What?

00:26:17.210 --> 00:26:18.710
Briareos!

00:26:19.170 --> 00:26:20.380
So you're okay now?

00:26:20.380 --> 00:26:23.180
Not quite... there must be something wrong with my eye scope.

00:26:23.180 --> 00:26:25.350
I'm seeing a side of you I've never seen before.

00:26:26.850 --> 00:26:28.100
Stop it.

00:26:29.140 --> 00:26:31.980
We're also celebrating Briareos' full recovery tonight.

00:26:31.980 --> 00:26:33.480
I had no idea...

00:26:41.860 --> 00:26:44.700
Happy birthday to you, Vice-Minister Hitomi.

00:26:44.700 --> 00:26:46.370
Oh, how lovely!

00:26:47.290 --> 00:26:48.450
Thank you very much!

00:26:50.450 --> 00:26:53.420
Oh, that's right.
You haven't met him yet, have you?

00:26:53.440 --> 00:26:55.100
This is Tereus.

00:26:56.650 --> 00:26:58.230
We meet at last...

00:26:59.190 --> 00:27:00.880
Nice to meet you.

00:27:04.140 --> 00:27:06.510
Is this supposed to be a costume party?

00:27:06.930 --> 00:27:09.610
This guy's wearing a mask of my old face.

00:27:10.350 --> 00:27:13.620
I'm not wearing it by choice.

00:27:16.460 --> 00:27:19.380
So you've got my attitude, too!

00:27:22.170 --> 00:27:23.920
Then we're back in business, right?

00:27:25.430 --> 00:27:27.260
Well, about that, Deunan...

00:27:27.260 --> 00:27:29.470
I want you to stay with Tereus a little longer.

00:27:31.290 --> 00:27:34.170
I decided to team up with Aeacus for a while.

00:27:34.170 --> 00:27:35.250
What do you mean?

00:27:35.810 --> 00:27:39.130
I saw you guys' combat data. Not bad.

00:27:39.570 --> 00:27:42.440
Are you serious? I'm against this!

00:27:43.110 --> 00:27:47.450
If I get destroyed for real,
who will you partner with then?

00:27:49.490 --> 00:27:50.970
I won't partner with anyone!

00:27:55.290 --> 00:27:56.400
Deunan!

00:28:23.490 --> 00:28:25.780
Briareos was worried about you.

00:28:27.030 --> 00:28:30.780
Whatever! After deciding everything on his own...

00:28:35.600 --> 00:28:36.520
Gimme another one!

00:28:36.520 --> 00:28:37.770
Make that a coffee.

00:28:39.020 --> 00:28:41.770
An espresso! With a liqueur.

00:28:43.230 --> 00:28:48.820
I know you don't like me,
but I'm glad you're my partner.

00:28:51.990 --> 00:28:54.870
Stick with me a little longer.

00:29:11.390 --> 00:29:12.600
Is something wrong?

00:29:13.100 --> 00:29:17.350
Briareos told you my coffee habits?

00:29:18.100 --> 00:29:19.310
Nope.

00:29:33.700 --> 00:29:34.950
Go home.

00:29:35.870 --> 00:29:37.540
Let me take you home.

00:29:38.460 --> 00:29:40.210
Leave me alone.

00:29:42.040 --> 00:29:45.960
I get confused when we're together.

00:29:48.510 --> 00:29:49.840
All right.

00:30:43.600 --> 00:30:47.480
Hechatonchires were giants with a hundred arms, right?

00:30:47.480 --> 00:30:49.690
Yeah, the word's from Greek mythology...

00:30:49.690 --> 00:30:53.490
The name of a system that controls countless external terminals.

00:30:53.950 --> 00:30:59.410
And <i>you're</i> the only human who could adopt a Hechatonchires class body!

00:30:59.410 --> 00:31:02.460
That's how much risk I take.

00:31:02.460 --> 00:31:05.420
Sucks, doesn't it?
Both of us bein' cyborgs and all...

00:31:05.420 --> 00:31:06.500
No joke.

00:31:06.880 --> 00:31:09.630
So, whatcha gonna do, pretty boy?

00:31:11.300 --> 00:31:13.180
I'm talkin' about Deunan!

00:31:13.180 --> 00:31:15.180
There just aren't that many girls who'll stay with you,

00:31:15.180 --> 00:31:17.180
even after you've ended up in a machine body!

00:31:18.140 --> 00:31:20.980
I know. That's why it's hard.

00:31:22.480 --> 00:31:25.190
Man, your love is twisted!

00:31:25.190 --> 00:31:26.730
And you? You got a girl?

00:31:26.730 --> 00:31:28.190
Huh?

00:31:28.190 --> 00:31:30.280
How about that earring, huh?

00:31:32.110 --> 00:31:35.490
You mean this? It's a Connexus.

00:31:35.490 --> 00:31:38.240
Got it from my daughter.
She's got a matching one.

00:31:38.240 --> 00:31:42.160
Still got love from the family even though you're a cyborg, huh?

00:31:42.160 --> 00:31:43.790
Don't be jealous!

00:31:43.790 --> 00:31:45.120
Who's jealous?

00:31:45.120 --> 00:31:46.580
Hey, that hurt!

00:32:02.640 --> 00:32:04.640
The vehicles carrying the world leaders are now arriving

00:32:04.640 --> 00:32:08.360
in front of Tartaros International Conference Center.

00:32:23.700 --> 00:32:26.120
All cyborgs have departed the premises.

00:32:26.120 --> 00:32:28.630
We'll continue with the security check.

00:32:32.670 --> 00:32:34.670
Deunan, it's about to start.

00:32:35.480 --> 00:32:36.220
Right...

00:32:36.880 --> 00:32:38.050
What's wrong?

00:32:40.140 --> 00:32:42.520
I'm sorry about the other day.

00:32:42.520 --> 00:32:45.890
Don't sweat it! I'm your partner.

00:32:45.890 --> 00:32:47.980
I've got your back anytime.

00:32:51.190 --> 00:32:52.530
Well, that's reassuring!

00:32:52.530 --> 00:32:54.690
What, didn't you know?

00:32:55.400 --> 00:32:59.530
Under very tight security, the conference that will forge our world's future

00:32:59.530 --> 00:33:01.410
is just about to get underway.

00:33:13.750 --> 00:33:18.010
I would now like to open the Security Conference.

00:33:22.300 --> 00:33:25.390
Prime Minister Athena is in.
It looks like the conference has started.

00:33:25.770 --> 00:33:28.850
Okay. All stations, stay sharp.

00:33:31.440 --> 00:33:33.230
They said it's started.

00:33:33.230 --> 00:33:36.150
All right. I hope nothing happens...

00:33:36.610 --> 00:33:40.110
Even if something does happen, it'll be fine because <i>we're here!</i>

00:33:40.110 --> 00:33:43.660
ES.W.A.T. is the shit, man!

00:33:48.870 --> 00:33:51.750
By unifying all countries' satellites

00:33:51.750 --> 00:33:54.460
we will be able to reconstruct the communications network

00:33:54.460 --> 00:33:55.960
destroyed during the war.

00:33:55.960 --> 00:33:59.840
This will quell conflicts and terrorist attacks before they happen.

00:33:59.840 --> 00:34:04.510
It is the sharing of information that we now seek.

00:34:06.430 --> 00:34:11.980
That was an overview of the global security network that Olympus proposes.

00:34:13.150 --> 00:34:17.690
I would like you all to put your countries' satellites

00:34:17.690 --> 00:34:19.700
under the temporary control of Olympus.

00:34:21.200 --> 00:34:23.200
The recent act of terrorism that occurred in our country

00:34:23.200 --> 00:34:26.540
was handled in a very expeditious manner by the Olympus ES.W.A.T.

00:34:26.540 --> 00:34:29.370
In order to establish a network of
cooperative relationships like this,

00:34:29.370 --> 00:34:30.790
the significance of this proposal...

00:34:30.790 --> 00:34:33.830
Well, <i>we have the means to protect our country from terrorists</i>

00:34:34.420 --> 00:34:37.210
without having to rely on support from Olympus.

00:34:37.210 --> 00:34:40.590
Sounds like you have certain things you don't want them seeing.

00:34:41.130 --> 00:34:44.220
Anything you would like to express further?

00:34:44.220 --> 00:34:45.510
We've obtained information

00:34:45.510 --> 00:34:47.680
that your country has been
supporting several conflicts...

00:34:47.680 --> 00:34:49.930
Ridiculous! That is an unfounded accusation!

00:34:49.930 --> 00:34:53.900
Anyway, why should humanity be put under the control of Olympus,

00:34:53.900 --> 00:34:55.360
which is governed by bioroids?

00:34:55.360 --> 00:34:57.320
Silence! This discussion isn't about race!

00:34:57.320 --> 00:34:59.490
Conferences like these are absolutely pointless!

00:35:00.490 --> 00:35:03.490
It's faint, but we've detected abnormal radio waves.

00:35:03.490 --> 00:35:05.240
Abnormal radio waves?!

00:35:05.240 --> 00:35:07.450
The source is... scattered around!

00:35:08.490 --> 00:35:10.160
All units, be on alert!

00:35:10.160 --> 00:35:13.210
Landmate unit, prepare to move out. Condition 3!

00:35:15.880 --> 00:35:17.210
Let's go, Aeacus.

00:35:18.050 --> 00:35:22.760
Sorry, but you go on ahead. I'll be right behind you.

00:35:23.260 --> 00:35:24.680
Are you all right?

00:35:24.680 --> 00:35:26.050
It's nothing.

00:35:31.890 --> 00:35:33.390
All right. You can go.

00:35:33.940 --> 00:35:35.060
Next!

00:35:39.230 --> 00:35:40.170
Hey!

00:35:42.700 --> 00:35:43.860
Stop!

00:35:43.860 --> 00:35:45.530
Stop! I said stop!

00:35:47.740 --> 00:35:48.780
Stop!

00:35:48.780 --> 00:35:50.790
They're not going to!
It's gonna plow right into us!

00:35:51.250 --> 00:35:52.750
I don't care, just shoot!

00:35:57.960 --> 00:35:59.960
Explosions confirmed at Gate E-12!

00:35:59.960 --> 00:36:02.260
Personnel at Gate E-12, report!

00:36:11.310 --> 00:36:13.390
Aeacus, I'm heading out.

00:36:25.610 --> 00:36:27.870
<i>This is Tartaros Front Gate A-2!</i>

00:36:27.870 --> 00:36:29.910
<i>Runaway vehicles are heading into the perimeter!</i>

00:36:30.490 --> 00:36:33.660
<i>Gate F, reporting the same situation!</i>

00:36:34.120 --> 00:36:36.790
At any rate, do not let a single vehicle inside!

00:36:36.790 --> 00:36:38.880
Send more Landmates!

00:36:39.290 --> 00:36:42.250
Deunan and Tereus,
back up the police in the area.

00:36:42.250 --> 00:36:45.300
Keep the terrorists away from the conference center!

00:36:45.300 --> 00:36:46.470
Roger!

00:36:51.600 --> 00:36:55.140
The areas around the conference center are under attack by runaway vehicles.

00:36:55.140 --> 00:36:57.640
We'll have to suspend the proceedings for now and take cover.

00:36:58.350 --> 00:37:01.360
There's no need for that.
We'll continue on course.

00:37:09.070 --> 00:37:10.990
That's a Landmate! Fire!

00:37:27.010 --> 00:37:28.550
Even a construction Landmate?!

00:37:39.600 --> 00:37:41.690
He's not a cyborg...

00:37:41.690 --> 00:37:44.020
He's an... ordinary human!

00:37:51.820 --> 00:37:53.780
<i>Are you okay, Deunan?</i>

00:37:53.780 --> 00:37:54.890
Yeah.

00:38:06.210 --> 00:38:09.380
What the hell is with them?
They're not just cyborgs either!

00:38:09.380 --> 00:38:11.720
There are human rioters, too!

00:38:18.980 --> 00:38:20.390
Please hurry.

00:38:20.390 --> 00:38:23.060
It looks like riots have occurred in more than four locations.

00:38:25.820 --> 00:38:27.150
Aeacus?

00:38:30.700 --> 00:38:33.780
All will... be... one...

00:38:33.780 --> 00:38:35.580
I am... Halcon.

00:38:43.830 --> 00:38:45.040
Aeacus?

00:38:46.000 --> 00:38:47.210
What was that?!

00:38:47.210 --> 00:38:48.460
It blew up!

00:38:48.460 --> 00:38:49.800
Is it terrorists?

00:38:51.430 --> 00:38:52.550
Stop the meeting!

00:38:52.550 --> 00:38:54.760
Where's the security?!

00:38:53.010 --> 00:38:54.760
Let us evacuate! This is dangerous!

00:38:55.100 --> 00:38:56.430
Quiet, please!

00:38:57.510 --> 00:39:02.850
Fear not. I guarantee the safety of
everyone in this conference center.

00:39:02.850 --> 00:39:05.190
Gentlemen, please return to your seats.

00:39:10.150 --> 00:39:12.070
Let us resume the discussion.

00:39:12.780 --> 00:39:14.950
Aeacus! What's wrong? Answer me!

00:39:14.950 --> 00:39:16.120
Aeacus!

00:39:26.840 --> 00:39:28.000
Stop!

00:39:32.630 --> 00:39:34.180
It's coming down!

00:39:34.180 --> 00:39:34.890
Look out!

00:39:37.970 --> 00:39:39.720
Help us!

00:39:39.720 --> 00:39:42.480
How can we conduct a meeting in these kinds of conditions?!

00:39:46.190 --> 00:39:50.440
Take a good look! This is the world we live in!

00:39:50.980 --> 00:39:54.110
I demand your decision!

00:39:54.110 --> 00:39:57.490
Or do you want more casualties?

00:40:04.500 --> 00:40:06.580
Stop it, Aeacus!

00:40:14.170 --> 00:40:16.010
Briareos!

00:40:33.070 --> 00:40:36.030
All will be one. Understand?

00:40:36.030 --> 00:40:37.200
Stop it!

00:40:46.160 --> 00:40:47.250
Damn!

00:40:55.050 --> 00:40:56.220
Stop it!

00:40:58.590 --> 00:41:00.600
Stop it, Aeacus!

00:41:01.010 --> 00:41:04.020
Briareos!

00:41:04.770 --> 00:41:07.190
Aeacus!

00:41:15.030 --> 00:41:17.280
Aeacus... Why?

00:41:18.740 --> 00:41:22.330
Bri... areos...

00:41:23.290 --> 00:41:24.790
I...

00:41:43.690 --> 00:41:44.350
Briareos!

00:41:58.450 --> 00:42:00.160
This thing's a robot!

00:42:01.160 --> 00:42:04.530
The abnormal radio waves are coming from the doves?!

00:42:07.160 --> 00:42:10.080
They seem to have the terrorists around the conference center under control.

00:42:10.620 --> 00:42:12.630
Huh? It vanished!

00:42:14.460 --> 00:42:16.420
Huh? Hey!

00:42:17.380 --> 00:42:19.420
What the heck just happened?

00:42:22.970 --> 00:42:26.470
The riots have been suppressed. There are many casualties.

00:42:26.470 --> 00:42:28.600
All abnormal radio waves have terminated!

00:42:28.600 --> 00:42:30.600
The conference has resumed.

00:42:36.530 --> 00:42:42.860
The Lord called brother Aeacus home.

00:42:43.620 --> 00:42:46.240
Let us pray for Aeacus' soul.

00:42:46.240 --> 00:42:50.830
Earth to earth, ashes to ashes, dust to dust...

00:42:52.210 --> 00:42:58.300
May the Lord lead him unto Heaven and grant him eternal rest.

00:43:25.240 --> 00:43:27.410
Do you think I'm sane?

00:43:28.490 --> 00:43:34.170
That moment, I felt like Aeacus' melting face was coming towards me.

00:43:36.460 --> 00:43:39.420
Maybe I've already lost it.

00:43:41.050 --> 00:43:42.550
You're overthinking this.

00:43:42.550 --> 00:43:45.550
Everyone recognizes that you did what was right.

00:43:47.680 --> 00:43:48.680
Salute!

00:44:16.710 --> 00:44:18.330
What's bothering you?

00:44:21.550 --> 00:44:25.590
The Hechatonchires system and your own flesh are so perfectly balanced,

00:44:25.590 --> 00:44:27.800
you're like a work of art.

00:44:28.760 --> 00:44:33.770
If we can't believe in that, then no cyborg is safe.

00:44:35.020 --> 00:44:37.980
I know what happened to Aeacus came as a shock to you,

00:44:37.980 --> 00:44:41.070
but something like that will never happen to you.

00:44:43.320 --> 00:44:46.530
I see. Thank you.

00:44:49.200 --> 00:44:51.030
Briareos.

00:44:52.990 --> 00:44:55.500
Do you like this city?

00:44:58.630 --> 00:45:03.260
Is Olympus a utopia that's worth protecting?

00:45:04.380 --> 00:45:06.130
I don't know.

00:45:06.130 --> 00:45:11.890
But if there's something that needs to be protected, then I will protect it.

00:45:11.890 --> 00:45:14.930
Sacrifice and love, huh?

00:45:15.930 --> 00:45:20.310
That always makes humans feel anguish and struggle.

00:45:20.310 --> 00:45:22.320
Don't you think so?

00:45:23.150 --> 00:45:24.820
No, I don't.

00:45:26.900 --> 00:45:28.490
Excuse me.

00:45:30.660 --> 00:45:32.660
Good answer.

00:45:42.460 --> 00:45:44.670
Although the Security Conference in Olympus was struck by a terrorist attack,

00:45:44.670 --> 00:45:47.550
the discussion ended successfully.

00:45:47.550 --> 00:45:50.470
The world powers moved closer towards unifying their satellite systems.

00:45:50.470 --> 00:45:53.680
It was a testament to Athena's strong leadership qualities, as well as...

00:45:55.350 --> 00:45:58.270
The result of our debate at the Olympus Parliament

00:45:58.270 --> 00:46:03.230
is that we will resume normal trade with Poseidon,

00:46:03.230 --> 00:46:06.530
excepting certain cyborg parts.

00:46:06.530 --> 00:46:09.070
Thank you for your consideration.

00:46:09.650 --> 00:46:12.030
I'll let headquarters know right away.

00:46:23.840 --> 00:46:26.170
We have received the report on
the investigation into the attack

00:46:26.170 --> 00:46:28.090
on the International Conference Center.

00:46:28.090 --> 00:46:30.050
There's something I'm concerned about.

00:46:30.050 --> 00:46:31.130
What is it?

00:46:31.130 --> 00:46:35.850
One of the offenders allegedly mumbled: "I am Halcon."

00:46:37.390 --> 00:46:38.650
That's impossible!

00:46:39.730 --> 00:46:42.270
Halcon is just a ghost from the past.

00:46:42.690 --> 00:46:45.320
What could they possibly do now?

00:47:05.750 --> 00:47:07.210
Checking ID.

00:47:08.420 --> 00:47:09.710
Thank you.

00:47:37.160 --> 00:47:39.080
Can I have a match?

00:47:41.160 --> 00:47:42.710
Why don't you ask Deunan?

00:47:46.330 --> 00:47:48.460
I want one with you.

00:48:29.840 --> 00:48:30.920
Oh...

00:48:30.920 --> 00:48:31.840
Not bad.

00:48:34.090 --> 00:48:35.680
Good kick.

00:48:59.280 --> 00:49:00.950
Are you happy now?

00:49:02.040 --> 00:49:05.080
Guess he really can't beat Briareos.

00:49:05.080 --> 00:49:08.080
Hey, the bioroid isn't bad either.

00:49:11.630 --> 00:49:13.420
We have discovered that the abnormal radio waves

00:49:13.420 --> 00:49:16.090
detected during the incident the other day

00:49:16.090 --> 00:49:18.760
were being transmitted through robot doves.

00:49:18.760 --> 00:49:20.300
We believe they are responsible

00:49:20.300 --> 00:49:25.310
for sending the virus program to the cyborgs and setting off the riots.

00:49:25.310 --> 00:49:27.770
However, the fact remains that non-cybernetic humans

00:49:27.770 --> 00:49:30.400
were also involved.

00:49:30.400 --> 00:49:33.070
The reason for this is still under investigation.

00:49:35.030 --> 00:49:39.110
We are now certain that this was the work of cyber terrorists.

00:49:39.990 --> 00:49:41.370
We're still investigating

00:49:41.370 --> 00:49:44.490
whether Officer Aeacus was
collaborating with the terrorists.

00:49:44.490 --> 00:49:46.700
At the same time, we can't ignore the possibility

00:49:46.700 --> 00:49:49.120
that ES.W.A.T.'s virus protection may have been breached.

00:49:49.790 --> 00:49:52.040
Until those issues are resolved,

00:49:52.040 --> 00:49:56.760
ES.W.A.T. will suspend the participation of cyborg troops in our operations.

00:49:56.760 --> 00:49:59.550
Wait a minute! Are you just letting the humans go free?

00:49:59.550 --> 00:50:02.550
Why treat us like criminals?!

00:50:02.550 --> 00:50:06.140
As long as the enemy's objectives
remain unclear, we have no choice!

00:50:06.930 --> 00:50:09.390
That is all. Dismissed!

00:50:22.620 --> 00:50:23.580
Yoshitsune!

00:50:27.950 --> 00:50:30.080
Will you test this for me?

00:50:31.710 --> 00:50:33.500
Some sort of bio-chip?

00:50:33.500 --> 00:50:35.000
Does this have anything to do with the incident?

00:50:35.000 --> 00:50:37.760
I don't know, but something
about it has been bugging me.

00:50:39.970 --> 00:50:41.470
Okay. I'll look into it.

00:50:41.470 --> 00:50:42.640
Thanks!

00:50:47.720 --> 00:50:48.810
Tereus!

00:50:50.390 --> 00:50:51.770
Let's go get a few drinks!

00:50:52.400 --> 00:50:53.480
I'll pass.

00:50:54.520 --> 00:50:57.480
A backup follows his point man!

00:50:58.820 --> 00:51:00.570
You heard her.

00:51:02.070 --> 00:51:04.070
Centralized management of every country's satellites

00:51:04.070 --> 00:51:06.080
along with the proposed system of information sharing

00:51:06.080 --> 00:51:08.160
could mean a first step towards fulfilling the wishes

00:51:08.160 --> 00:51:10.750
of those who long for peace in this post-war world.

00:51:10.750 --> 00:51:12.670
With this as an important step,

00:51:12.670 --> 00:51:14.790
Olympus will undoubtedly seek to establish...

00:51:14.080 --> 00:51:16.500
Hey, where should we go?

00:51:16.500 --> 00:51:18.000
Pub or sports bar?

00:51:18.710 --> 00:51:19.960
Sports bar.

00:51:18.730 --> 00:51:19.980
Sports bar.

00:51:21.970 --> 00:51:24.090
No, pub.

00:51:32.560 --> 00:51:38.270
Here it is now... the announcement by Prime Minister Athena.

00:51:38.980 --> 00:51:45.740
As of now, Olympus controls 482 global satellites

00:51:45.740 --> 00:51:48.080
belonging to 32 nations worldwide.

00:52:10.260 --> 00:52:16.400
It's the olive tree, a symbol of peace and prosperity in Greek mythology.

00:52:17.810 --> 00:52:22.440
I am sure people's desire for peace will unite this world.

00:52:34.080 --> 00:52:35.750
It's like some kind of carnival.

00:52:35.750 --> 00:52:36.580
Pretty cool.

00:52:53.930 --> 00:52:54.810
Briareos!

00:53:09.070 --> 00:53:10.580
There's no driver.

00:53:43.400 --> 00:53:44.730
That's an information terminal!

00:53:44.730 --> 00:53:45.400
Briareos!

00:53:50.780 --> 00:53:51.700
Stop it, Bri!

00:53:51.700 --> 00:53:54.240
What's gotten into you?! What are you doing?

00:53:58.660 --> 00:53:59.670
Watch out!

00:54:00.210 --> 00:54:01.460
S-Stop it!

00:54:04.590 --> 00:54:05.460
Tereus?

00:54:08.070 --> 00:54:09.630
What's happened to you?

00:54:10.010 --> 00:54:11.760
Briareos!

00:54:11.760 --> 00:54:15.010
Stop it! Stop, Briareos! Hey!

00:54:24.940 --> 00:54:27.610
Error detected in satellite monitoring system!

00:54:27.610 --> 00:54:29.990
The electrical supply system is malfunctioning, too!

00:54:31.030 --> 00:54:33.160
We've been hacked into from outside.
Code yellow!

00:54:33.700 --> 00:54:35.990
Switch it over to the sub-system, just to be safe.

00:54:35.990 --> 00:54:38.330
Understood. Switching to the sub-system!

00:55:07.900 --> 00:55:11.990
The abnormal radio waves haven't been detected in that area...

00:55:12.610 --> 00:55:14.620
So that probably wasn't the cause.

00:55:15.320 --> 00:55:20.080
They're going to conduct a drug test
and a psychiatric examination on him.

00:55:20.080 --> 00:55:21.080
Where is he now?

00:55:21.910 --> 00:55:23.960
In the isolation ward here.

00:55:23.960 --> 00:55:25.460
Did you go to see him?

00:55:27.800 --> 00:55:30.300
He didn't want to see me.

00:55:32.050 --> 00:55:33.380
Oh...

00:55:38.680 --> 00:55:40.020
I'll do it.

00:55:40.020 --> 00:55:43.100
Okay, I'll let you handle it.

00:55:48.690 --> 00:55:50.030
Turn around.

00:55:51.070 --> 00:55:52.400
Thanks.

00:55:59.950 --> 00:56:01.330
This birthmark...

00:56:02.870 --> 00:56:05.250
It's just like Briareos'.

00:56:07.420 --> 00:56:10.380
What's gotten into him? Briareos...

00:56:34.110 --> 00:56:38.120
The debris chip Deunan brought
turned out to be part of a Connexus.

00:56:38.990 --> 00:56:41.370
This is a mouse with a Connexus attached to it.

00:56:41.370 --> 00:56:43.200
If I transmit the same signal

00:56:43.200 --> 00:56:46.170
obtained from a microchip taken from one of the robot doves...

00:56:55.340 --> 00:56:57.180
Its mind is taken over!

00:56:57.760 --> 00:57:00.300
It seems that the Connexus emits a certain frequency

00:57:00.300 --> 00:57:03.060
that can affect organic nerve tissue at an extremely close range.

00:57:03.060 --> 00:57:07.850
This can be used to manipulate humans and cyborgs alike.

00:57:10.440 --> 00:57:13.860
That explains why humans were also involved in the riots, correct?

00:57:13.860 --> 00:57:15.030
Yes, sir.

00:57:16.030 --> 00:57:18.860
So Aeacus was innocent!

00:57:20.240 --> 00:57:22.990
He really was just another victim.

00:57:26.960 --> 00:57:31.540
So rethinking this, what the culprit
wants isn't simply cyborg terrorists,

00:57:32.040 --> 00:57:33.630
but something much larger...

00:57:33.630 --> 00:57:36.970
So the attack on the International
Conference Center was just a test?!

00:57:37.340 --> 00:57:39.890
Please ban the use of the Connexus right away!

00:57:39.890 --> 00:57:41.220
All right.

00:57:44.810 --> 00:57:48.810
So I really did... attack Deunan?

00:57:53.070 --> 00:57:55.400
What's gotten into me?

00:57:56.150 --> 00:57:58.900
Deunan was very worried about you.

00:57:58.900 --> 00:58:00.160
She wants to see you.

00:58:03.240 --> 00:58:04.540
Not now.

00:58:06.580 --> 00:58:08.210
Is there anything I can do?

00:58:11.500 --> 00:58:14.250
Richard Kestner...

00:58:16.960 --> 00:58:21.930
He has belonged to the Olympus Science Academy since 2135.

00:58:21.930 --> 00:58:24.060
It looks like he was with Poseidon before that.

00:58:24.060 --> 00:58:25.220
Poseidon?

00:58:26.430 --> 00:58:28.180
I want more information.

00:58:28.560 --> 00:58:31.190
I'll try accessing Gaia's host computer.

00:58:38.820 --> 00:58:42.110
Director of Technology, Elizabeth Xander...

00:58:45.280 --> 00:58:47.790
Halcon Laboratory?

00:58:47.790 --> 00:58:49.040
Halcon?

00:58:49.040 --> 00:58:50.620
Let me check.

00:58:55.420 --> 00:58:57.000
It's been erased?

00:58:57.460 --> 00:58:58.960
Is this Kestner's handiwork?

00:59:00.970 --> 00:59:02.720
Kestner could never erase

00:59:02.720 --> 00:59:06.350
<i>all</i> of that data from the
worldwide network on his own.

00:59:06.350 --> 00:59:08.140
Something bigger is involved.

00:59:11.140 --> 00:59:12.810
Poseidon, then.

00:59:14.650 --> 00:59:16.650
Hitomi, cover your ears.

00:59:18.440 --> 00:59:20.320
No, Briareos!

00:59:20.320 --> 00:59:22.360
I'll visit him and make sure!

00:59:22.360 --> 00:59:24.780
Please don't do it! If you do that you'll be...

00:59:34.210 --> 00:59:35.170
This way!

00:59:35.840 --> 00:59:38.000
What do you think you're doing?

00:59:38.000 --> 00:59:39.840
Your wound hasn't healed yet.

00:59:39.840 --> 00:59:41.880
I have to go after him! I have to go after Briareos!

00:59:41.880 --> 00:59:43.260
Go back to your room!

00:59:43.840 --> 00:59:45.970
I have to stop his rampage!

01:00:03.650 --> 01:00:04.740
We're going to run through them!

01:00:24.720 --> 01:00:27.220
Attention, citizens:

01:00:27.220 --> 01:00:30.310
The Connexus is now considered to be a harmful product.

01:00:30.310 --> 01:00:32.770
Attention, citizens...

01:00:32.770 --> 01:00:34.100
What's going on?

01:00:34.100 --> 01:00:35.850
What am I supposed to do then?

01:00:35.850 --> 01:00:37.730
I need mine!

01:00:35.850 --> 01:00:37.730
If you are a Connexus user,

01:00:37.730 --> 01:00:40.320
please turn the device in at your nearest government agency.

01:00:41.940 --> 01:00:45.990
We'll probably end up retrieving less than 10% of them.

01:00:46.410 --> 01:00:49.070
Prepare to take enforcement
measures as early as tomorrow.

01:00:49.070 --> 01:00:50.160
Yes, ma'am.

01:00:50.160 --> 01:00:51.240
Administrator Nike!

01:00:51.240 --> 01:00:52.370
What is it?

01:00:52.370 --> 01:00:56.790
An ES.W.A.T. cyborg has taken
Vice-Minister Hitomi hostage and escaped!

01:01:07.890 --> 01:01:10.550
I'm sure everyone is very well aware of Briareos' power.

01:01:11.430 --> 01:01:13.060
Do not let your guard down!

01:01:13.810 --> 01:01:15.140
All right, move out!

01:01:16.440 --> 01:01:17.560
Deunan Knute!

01:01:18.770 --> 01:01:20.560
Withdraw from this assignment.

01:01:21.070 --> 01:01:21.900
Why?

01:01:21.900 --> 01:01:24.400
That's an order. You understand, right?

01:01:24.940 --> 01:01:26.780
Remain here on stand-by.

01:01:26.780 --> 01:01:27.950
Got it?

01:01:48.130 --> 01:01:51.140
Pull your vehicle over immediately.

01:01:51.140 --> 01:01:52.930
Give up this pointless chase!

01:01:54.310 --> 01:01:55.600
What should we do?

01:01:55.600 --> 01:01:56.810
So we can't go any further...

01:01:56.810 --> 01:01:59.140
I repeat: Stop your vehicle immediately!

01:01:59.770 --> 01:02:02.020
I'm sorry to have gotten you mixed up in this!

01:02:02.020 --> 01:02:03.520
Do you have a gun?

01:02:03.520 --> 01:02:04.820
I don't need one.

01:02:27.170 --> 01:02:29.220
We've taken protective custody of the hostage.

01:02:29.680 --> 01:02:32.180
Briareos' whereabouts are still unknown.

01:02:34.390 --> 01:02:36.720
Where is Briareos?

01:02:37.810 --> 01:02:39.640
How would I know?

01:02:40.350 --> 01:02:41.690
Why are you asking me?

01:02:42.690 --> 01:02:49.990
If you won't tell me,
then I'll just ask myself what I'd do.

01:02:52.910 --> 01:02:57.910
<i>Briareos took Harbor Highway 4 and got off somewhere around Cygnus Street.</i>

01:02:57.910 --> 01:03:00.410
<i>We are checking vehicles within a one-kilometer radius of the area.</i>

01:03:00.410 --> 01:03:02.920
<i>All members work together to conduct a thorough search.</i>

01:03:07.460 --> 01:03:09.300
This is a pretty bleak room.

01:03:15.470 --> 01:03:17.390
You live here all alone?

01:03:19.220 --> 01:03:20.890
No.

01:03:20.890 --> 01:03:22.850
I am not alone.

01:03:23.560 --> 01:03:25.610
What have you done to my body?

01:03:26.860 --> 01:03:32.320
Your body can't be controlled by radio waves from the outside.

01:03:33.570 --> 01:03:37.660
Your little incident the other day
gave me the perfect opportunity.

01:03:37.660 --> 01:03:41.830
I added something to that troublesome Hechatonchires body at no extra charge.

01:03:42.920 --> 01:03:44.120
Nano machines.

01:03:44.790 --> 01:03:46.170
Nano machines?!

01:03:46.170 --> 01:03:50.460
They feed off of <i>you</i>.

01:03:51.470 --> 01:03:58.390
I programmed them to activate when your adrenaline goes beyond a certain point.

01:03:59.600 --> 01:04:03.350
The hacking incident you caused was all part of the plan.

01:04:04.770 --> 01:04:08.110
You see, it was too difficult to
infiltrate the main control room

01:04:08.110 --> 01:04:09.820
of the satellite control center.

01:04:11.530 --> 01:04:15.200
So I performed a little trick on their backup system.

01:04:17.530 --> 01:04:21.540
All that was needed then was to crash the main system.

01:04:22.330 --> 01:04:25.330
And you did that wonderfully.

01:04:26.790 --> 01:04:28.630
What the hell do you want?

01:04:29.250 --> 01:04:33.260
Do you know why this world will never be without bloodshed?

01:04:34.470 --> 01:04:36.640
Because of individual differences!

01:04:37.090 --> 01:04:41.680
Different bodies, different hearts... It's the essence of all conflict.

01:04:42.680 --> 01:04:46.310
So we must become a single, united consciousness.

01:04:46.310 --> 01:04:48.650
A single consciousness?

01:04:48.650 --> 01:04:50.730
So you provoked those terrorist attacks?!

01:04:51.610 --> 01:04:54.360
I have comrades around the world!

01:04:54.360 --> 01:04:56.740
Put my body back to normal!

01:04:57.610 --> 01:04:59.660
Too late for that.

01:05:00.450 --> 01:05:01.990
It is time...

01:05:09.000 --> 01:05:11.960
System error, we are unable to control the satellites!

01:05:11.960 --> 01:05:14.010
We've lost all satellites links!

01:05:14.010 --> 01:05:15.090
What the heck is going on?!

01:05:15.090 --> 01:05:16.510
We're having problems with the backup system!

01:05:16.510 --> 01:05:17.220
What?!

01:05:17.930 --> 01:05:19.510
What are you trying to start?

01:05:20.760 --> 01:05:23.350
Integration and natural selection.

01:05:23.350 --> 01:05:26.190
What cannot be integrated will disappear.

01:05:27.020 --> 01:05:29.520
Thanks to the Connexus and the satellite network,

01:05:29.520 --> 01:05:32.320
humanity will share one consciousness.

01:05:32.320 --> 01:05:36.240
A world without misunderstanding or discrimination will be created.

01:05:36.610 --> 01:05:40.280
There won't be conflict or war.

01:05:41.120 --> 01:05:45.290
Halcon's ideals will finally be reality!

01:05:45.620 --> 01:05:46.620
Halcon?

01:05:46.620 --> 01:05:48.870
<i>The global security network is down!</i>

01:05:48.870 --> 01:05:50.630
<i>We can't control any satellites!</i>

01:05:50.630 --> 01:05:52.290
<i>The global security network is down!</i>

01:05:53.210 --> 01:05:56.720
They waited for us to unite the
satellites before stealing them...

01:05:56.720 --> 01:05:58.800
Even the terrorist attack on the International Conference

01:05:58.800 --> 01:06:00.220
had been so thoroughly premeditated...

01:06:01.090 --> 01:06:05.270
What if they transmitted that signal to the Connexus, using all the satellites?

01:06:08.350 --> 01:06:11.520
Issue an emergency alert worldwide!

01:06:11.520 --> 01:06:12.520
Yes, ma'am.

01:06:14.070 --> 01:06:18.570
Soon you, too, will understand it.

01:06:19.200 --> 01:06:21.820
A body is just a vessel!

01:06:25.220 --> 01:06:29.710
We're going to free our souls!

01:06:30.250 --> 01:06:31.750
Wait! Don't do it!

01:06:54.110 --> 01:06:55.610
I've found him! He's right here!

01:06:55.610 --> 01:06:56.940
Don't move!

01:06:56.940 --> 01:06:58.610
You're Briareos, aren't you?

01:06:58.610 --> 01:07:01.150
We've found the escaped
ES.W.A.T. trooper Briareos!

01:07:01.150 --> 01:07:03.370
One man shot and down. Send an ambulance!

01:07:18.550 --> 01:07:19.420
Don't move!

01:07:19.420 --> 01:07:20.380
Wait!

01:07:26.140 --> 01:07:27.310
Did he jump?

01:07:31.690 --> 01:07:32.730
He fell!

01:07:32.730 --> 01:07:34.310
Down there! Chase him!

01:07:34.310 --> 01:07:36.150
The culprit jumped from the window!

01:07:36.150 --> 01:07:37.650
We'll continue our pursuit!

01:07:40.320 --> 01:07:42.450
<i>Briareos is still on the run.</i>

01:07:42.450 --> 01:07:45.160
<i>Find him quickly and capture him!</i>

01:07:45.160 --> 01:07:46.830
<i>He's in a dangerous state.</i>

01:07:46.830 --> 01:07:50.410
<i>If he resists... shoot to kill!</i>

01:07:51.500 --> 01:07:56.500
<i>I repeat: Briareos is probably</i> <i>moving towards south on Cygnus Street.</i>

01:07:59.250 --> 01:08:03.340
I'll protect you, even if the world comes to an end.

01:08:10.140 --> 01:08:11.220
Yoshitsune!

01:08:12.020 --> 01:08:14.190
Looks like nothing can stop you.

01:08:15.690 --> 01:08:17.860
Give this to Briareos.

01:08:20.480 --> 01:08:22.070
What are these?

01:08:23.110 --> 01:08:24.990
Parasite counters.

01:08:24.990 --> 01:08:27.160
They were developed during the war as a countermeasure

01:08:27.160 --> 01:08:28.830
against cyber-terrorism caused by cyborgs.

01:08:28.830 --> 01:08:31.830
It's a kind of shock treatment.
It will help him regain consciousness.

01:08:33.210 --> 01:08:35.460
If Briareos starts losing it again,

01:08:35.460 --> 01:08:38.630
shoot this into his nervous system from the back of his neck.

01:08:40.340 --> 01:08:42.630
So this can save him?

01:08:43.300 --> 01:08:46.220
It's only an emergency measure, but still better than nothing.

01:08:54.140 --> 01:08:57.230
Thank you, Yoshitsune.

01:09:16.790 --> 01:09:18.130
Briareos!

01:09:21.130 --> 01:09:23.460
I knew you'd come here.

01:09:25.380 --> 01:09:29.140
So you know exactly what I'm thinking, do you?

01:09:30.470 --> 01:09:31.890
Just turn yourself in!

01:09:31.890 --> 01:09:34.600
Don't get any closer!

01:09:35.930 --> 01:09:37.140
I'm at my limit!

01:09:50.200 --> 01:09:51.120
Briareos!

01:09:52.280 --> 01:09:55.040
Who... are you?

01:09:55.950 --> 01:09:59.460
Why is there another me?!

01:10:01.960 --> 01:10:05.300
Why've you got what I've lost?!

01:10:07.300 --> 01:10:08.880
All will be... one...

01:10:09.800 --> 01:10:12.140
Stop calling out to me!

01:10:29.700 --> 01:10:30.530
Deunan!

01:10:32.070 --> 01:10:33.990
Briareos!!

01:10:36.540 --> 01:10:38.120
Tereus, hold Bri down!

01:10:42.290 --> 01:10:43.670
Briareos!

01:10:46.960 --> 01:10:50.050
It's no use, Deunan! Briareos has...

01:10:50.680 --> 01:10:52.180
Don't give me that!

01:10:56.970 --> 01:11:01.140
I swear I'll...

01:11:01.140 --> 01:11:03.310
bring you back!

01:11:10.200 --> 01:11:11.530
Briareos!

01:11:18.580 --> 01:11:21.410
Briareos.

01:11:33.720 --> 01:11:34.550
Deunan.

01:11:35.220 --> 01:11:38.390
You recognize me, right? Bri...

01:11:38.390 --> 01:11:39.810
Thank goodness.

01:11:48.320 --> 01:11:53.030
Sorry. I'm taking him into custody.

01:11:53.030 --> 01:11:53.780
Tereus?

01:11:55.450 --> 01:11:56.780
It's too late.

01:12:41.700 --> 01:12:43.290
What's going on?

01:12:51.630 --> 01:12:54.970
Riots are breaking out throughout Olympus! We're currently verifying their scope!

01:12:54.970 --> 01:12:57.140
We have lost communication with the other countries!

01:12:57.140 --> 01:12:58.800
Unable to assess the situation!

01:12:58.800 --> 01:13:00.260
Powerful abnormal radio waves confirmed!

01:13:00.260 --> 01:13:03.060
They are being emitted from every country's satellites!

01:13:03.060 --> 01:13:06.390
Is this happening all over the world?

01:13:07.560 --> 01:13:10.900
This is... war!

01:13:11.270 --> 01:13:14.780
ES.W.A.T. will work with the police to suppress the riots!

01:13:15.490 --> 01:13:20.080
They are not terrorists!
They're just civilians who are being controlled!

01:13:20.080 --> 01:13:26.330
Try not to hurt them,
but if worse comes to worst...

01:13:30.340 --> 01:13:33.670
Bringing the riots under control is our top priority! Understood?

01:13:49.310 --> 01:13:51.860
Stay back... Stay the hell back!

01:13:58.320 --> 01:14:00.450
Shit! How did this happen?!

01:14:02.240 --> 01:14:06.000
Control the civilians through their Connexus network to take over the world?!

01:14:06.000 --> 01:14:08.290
That's what the enemy is after?

01:14:12.170 --> 01:14:12.880
Crap!

01:14:14.000 --> 01:14:15.010
This way!

01:14:15.010 --> 01:14:16.340
We can't go this way either.

01:14:17.630 --> 01:14:19.180
There's no end to them!

01:14:19.180 --> 01:14:20.720
We must destroy the source!

01:14:25.890 --> 01:14:26.980
"Halcon"...

01:14:27.680 --> 01:14:29.230
That's what Kestner called it.

01:14:29.980 --> 01:14:31.940
Poseidon is behind this!

01:14:31.940 --> 01:14:34.110
They're hiding something.

01:14:35.110 --> 01:14:37.110
The ship carrying Poseidon's special representative

01:14:37.110 --> 01:14:38.740
should be at sea nearby!

01:14:38.740 --> 01:14:40.200
Let's go, Briareos!

01:14:41.410 --> 01:14:43.490
<i>Tereus, come in!</i>

01:14:43.490 --> 01:14:45.490
<i>Riots are breaking out all over.</i>

01:14:45.490 --> 01:14:47.080
<i>Is Briareos in custody yet?</i>

01:14:47.910 --> 01:14:49.750
<i>Report your status!</i>

01:14:53.080 --> 01:14:54.840
This is Tereus.

01:14:55.750 --> 01:14:57.880
Briareos was...

01:14:59.470 --> 01:15:01.050
...shot to death.

01:15:01.050 --> 01:15:03.930
Repeat: Briareos was shot to death.

01:15:03.930 --> 01:15:05.930
There is no need for backup.

01:15:08.980 --> 01:15:12.980
Thanks to the two of you, I just told my first lie.

01:15:13.650 --> 01:15:15.400
I'm coming, too.

01:15:15.400 --> 01:15:18.150
I'm Deunan's partner, after all.

01:15:18.940 --> 01:15:20.450
Tereus...

01:15:27.830 --> 01:15:29.620
I brought them with me, Deunan!

01:15:36.210 --> 01:15:39.090
The estimated size of the riots is in the hundreds of thousands.

01:15:39.090 --> 01:15:42.800
They are all moving towards Tartaros!

01:15:50.430 --> 01:15:53.440
Hold your positions!
Avoid using deadly force if at all possible!

01:16:21.380 --> 01:16:22.420
That's it!

01:16:31.140 --> 01:16:33.600
This is urgent business. Let's skip the formalities.

01:16:34.600 --> 01:16:36.150
I know.

01:16:39.730 --> 01:16:42.070
There are just two things we want to know about.

01:16:42.070 --> 01:16:44.740
What is Halcon? Where is it?

01:16:45.700 --> 01:16:49.740
Halcon used to be one of Poseidon's research departments.

01:16:50.910 --> 01:16:53.710
With Professor Elizabeth Xander as the head of research,

01:16:53.710 --> 01:16:58.130
they developed and programmed rehabilitation devices

01:16:58.130 --> 01:17:01.800
for individuals who had been handicapped in the war.

01:17:02.880 --> 01:17:06.720
Using artificial intelligence and cyborg technologies,

01:17:06.720 --> 01:17:09.850
they saved a great amount of people.

01:17:11.100 --> 01:17:13.890
They were like gods...

01:17:13.890 --> 01:17:19.900
Their self-confidence led them to develop a distorted perception of peace.

01:17:20.400 --> 01:17:22.400
The Connexus is another of Halcon's inventions, right?

01:17:22.980 --> 01:17:24.530
Most likely...

01:17:24.990 --> 01:17:28.160
The method they use is just plain mind-control.

01:17:29.070 --> 01:17:32.830
We shut down Halcon immediately and dispersed its staff.

01:17:33.700 --> 01:17:35.540
Shortly after that...

01:17:37.080 --> 01:17:39.540
Professor Xander died in an accident.

01:17:49.220 --> 01:17:51.390
You did it all, didn't you?

01:17:52.010 --> 01:17:54.810
The only thing you care about is protecting your own business.

01:17:54.810 --> 01:17:56.980
Here's the result of your arrogance!

01:18:01.270 --> 01:18:03.980
Where is it? Where is Halcon?

01:18:16.410 --> 01:18:20.290
This is Halcon's maritime zero-gravity plant.

01:18:20.960 --> 01:18:22.590
The facility was sold off a while back.

01:18:23.170 --> 01:18:24.800
It should've been converted

01:18:24.800 --> 01:18:27.840
into a large-scale unmanned industrial plant by now.

01:18:30.430 --> 01:18:32.140
It's not that far from here.

01:18:32.140 --> 01:18:33.680
We're going to Halcon!

01:18:33.680 --> 01:18:36.470
Before it takes us over...

01:18:36.470 --> 01:18:38.430
I'll crush it myself!

01:18:38.430 --> 01:18:41.190
We have to recover our world!

01:18:44.320 --> 01:18:48.740
We will supply you with the latest equipment and a task force.

01:18:49.400 --> 01:18:51.030
Consider it a good faith gesture.

01:18:51.860 --> 01:18:54.700
Arges will handle the rest.

01:18:54.700 --> 01:18:57.540
We're coming, too. We're taking off right away.

01:19:16.220 --> 01:19:19.680
A human, a bioroid, a cyborg...

01:19:20.730 --> 01:19:24.730
Those three are Olympus' hope...

01:19:34.660 --> 01:19:37.370
So what do you think about Poseidon's latest model?

01:19:37.950 --> 01:19:40.580
It's a prototype, but I'll put it through its paces.

01:19:42.170 --> 01:19:46.130
If we can stop the signal coming from Halcon, will you recover?

01:19:48.550 --> 01:19:50.130
Pray that I do.

01:19:51.380 --> 01:19:53.340
Our target will be in view ahead momentarily.

01:19:53.340 --> 01:19:55.640
All Landmates, prepare to take off!

01:20:18.280 --> 01:20:20.200
This is... Halcon.

01:20:21.000 --> 01:20:23.210
It's bigger than I imagined.

01:20:24.500 --> 01:20:27.460
Halcon's nerve center should be located in the center of this.

01:20:28.210 --> 01:20:34.260
We'll escort three of Olympus' craft to the central section of Halcon.

01:20:34.260 --> 01:20:36.180
We don't know what awaits us,

01:20:36.180 --> 01:20:39.060
but we'll end Halcon's terrorism by any means necessary! Got it?

01:20:47.360 --> 01:20:51.320
Fortunately, the marine city below is no longer manned.

01:20:51.320 --> 01:20:53.860
No need to worry about innocent bystanders.

01:21:04.790 --> 01:21:06.290
It's moving!

01:21:08.210 --> 01:21:09.170
Watch out!

01:21:11.340 --> 01:21:12.760
Dive into the rightward gutter!

01:21:13.590 --> 01:21:15.380
Wh-What the...?!

01:21:16.050 --> 01:21:16.930
Here comes another one!

01:21:19.220 --> 01:21:21.930
We should reach the central area after we clear this corridor.

01:21:28.060 --> 01:21:29.400
This place is...

01:21:31.360 --> 01:21:33.820
So that's the center of Halcon?

01:21:40.660 --> 01:21:43.740
Look! A swarm of those drones!

01:21:44.790 --> 01:21:46.000
They're coming!

01:21:59.970 --> 01:22:02.010
Return fire while maneuvering!

01:22:02.010 --> 01:22:03.600
If you stop, they'll get you!

01:22:19.860 --> 01:22:20.740
Briareos!

01:22:22.120 --> 01:22:23.240
What the...

01:22:27.410 --> 01:22:28.710
Briareos!

01:22:29.830 --> 01:22:31.540
Stay back!

01:22:40.970 --> 01:22:42.430
Briareos...

01:22:43.170 --> 01:22:44.680
Snap out of it!

01:22:46.930 --> 01:22:47.680
Deunan!

01:22:54.570 --> 01:22:56.400
Are you two all right?

01:22:59.740 --> 01:23:02.370
I'm all right... Sorry.

01:23:03.120 --> 01:23:06.790
There's a second wave of them coming! Everyone, close formation!

01:23:06.790 --> 01:23:09.250
We'll concentrate our remaining strength on reaching the center!

01:23:11.330 --> 01:23:13.000
Tereus...

01:23:13.790 --> 01:23:16.300
I only have one dose left.

01:23:16.300 --> 01:23:19.510
But my nerves can't handle another dose.

01:23:22.010 --> 01:23:24.390
If I go nuts again, it's over.

01:23:24.390 --> 01:23:27.140
If that happens, don't hold back, just shoot me. All right?

01:23:28.220 --> 01:23:29.680
Why me?

01:23:30.980 --> 01:23:32.980
I'm counting on you.

01:23:32.980 --> 01:23:34.560
Briareos...

01:23:34.560 --> 01:23:35.610
Incoming!

01:23:40.320 --> 01:23:42.240
Maintain formation!

01:23:42.240 --> 01:23:43.910
We'll cut straight through them!

01:23:48.120 --> 01:23:49.000
That's...

01:23:59.760 --> 01:24:01.760
What have we got now?!

01:24:17.150 --> 01:24:18.320
What the...

01:24:21.860 --> 01:24:23.860
Damn! It's fast!

01:24:30.910 --> 01:24:32.290
My bullets aren't even scratching it!

01:24:41.090 --> 01:24:43.050
Deunan! Are you all right?!

01:24:43.050 --> 01:24:43.720
Yeah!

01:24:43.720 --> 01:24:45.050
Where's the other one?

01:24:47.970 --> 01:24:49.060
Over there?

01:24:49.060 --> 01:24:52.480
Bri, Tereus, we can do this!

01:24:52.480 --> 01:24:54.190
We'll distract the drones!

01:24:54.190 --> 01:24:55.560
You take care of that one!

01:24:55.560 --> 01:24:56.270
Got it!

01:24:57.980 --> 01:25:00.480
Go, Deunan! Leave these to us!

01:25:09.370 --> 01:25:10.740
Make sure you keep 'em on you!

01:25:10.740 --> 01:25:11.830
You do the same!

01:25:38.230 --> 01:25:39.110
Out of bullets.

01:25:51.490 --> 01:25:52.370
Where is it?

01:26:05.050 --> 01:26:05.920
I'm not done yet!

01:26:14.010 --> 01:26:15.310
Go!

01:26:49.760 --> 01:26:51.800
These guys are amazing...

01:26:53.390 --> 01:26:56.220
The central gate is... closing!

01:27:01.130 --> 01:27:02.980
I'll secure the gate.

01:27:02.980 --> 01:27:04.820
Tereus, you take care of Deunan!

01:27:05.440 --> 01:27:06.730
I'm one step ahead of you!

01:27:08.650 --> 01:27:09.570
Hurry!

01:27:14.830 --> 01:27:15.830
Deunan!

01:27:15.830 --> 01:27:16.870
Tereus!

01:27:16.870 --> 01:27:18.120
Let's go.

01:27:26.050 --> 01:27:27.380
Tereus, hurry!

01:27:36.720 --> 01:27:39.020
We're going to eject and jump through the door!

01:27:39.020 --> 01:27:39.640
Roger!

01:28:25.690 --> 01:28:27.940
Stay away! Stay away!

01:28:27.940 --> 01:28:29.570
Stay the hell away!

01:28:37.070 --> 01:28:39.660
What cannot be integrated will disappear.

01:28:42.370 --> 01:28:43.410
No...

01:28:43.410 --> 01:28:44.250
Stop!

01:28:48.170 --> 01:28:49.000
Are you all right?

01:28:50.750 --> 01:28:51.760
Daddy.

01:28:51.760 --> 01:28:53.090
Daddy, get up!

01:28:53.090 --> 01:28:56.090
Daddy! Daddy!!

01:29:02.930 --> 01:29:05.560
Section E Police Commander, come in!

01:29:05.560 --> 01:29:08.020
The surveillance cameras have been destroyed.

01:29:08.020 --> 01:29:09.650
We can't contact Section S either!

01:29:09.650 --> 01:29:12.820
We have lost monitoring capabilities throughout Olympus!

01:29:13.690 --> 01:29:18.120
This is Lance. All ES.W.A.T. troops,
report your status!

01:29:18.120 --> 01:29:20.410
Come in! Come in!

01:29:20.410 --> 01:29:23.040
What the heck's happening to Olympus?!

01:29:49.360 --> 01:29:51.520
Is that... Xander?

01:29:51.520 --> 01:29:53.440
Kestner and his associates must have revived her.

01:30:00.740 --> 01:30:01.910
Briareos!

01:30:07.540 --> 01:30:08.960
Deunan!

01:30:10.000 --> 01:30:11.840
Go ahead and shoot.

01:30:11.840 --> 01:30:18.050
Kill me, and you also lose all who have merged with Halcon.

01:30:19.220 --> 01:30:22.890
Including the Hechatonchires, of course!

01:30:24.560 --> 01:30:28.270
How can we... stop Halcon?

01:30:29.400 --> 01:30:31.110
Give up...

01:30:31.980 --> 01:30:36.570
and become one with Halcon yourselves!

01:30:47.080 --> 01:30:47.790
Deunan!

01:30:59.430 --> 01:31:00.800
Briareos!

01:31:00.800 --> 01:31:02.180
Answer me!

01:31:02.180 --> 01:31:04.050
Briareos!

01:31:22.990 --> 01:31:25.410
Not like this...

01:31:33.790 --> 01:31:34.880
Briareos!

01:31:35.590 --> 01:31:40.340
There must be some shred of humanity left in Xander...

01:31:40.340 --> 01:31:41.180
Deunan!

01:31:44.300 --> 01:31:48.350
Help... me...

01:31:58.320 --> 01:32:00.400
People's hearts...

01:32:02.400 --> 01:32:05.780
aren't something you can just take away and unify!

01:32:22.590 --> 01:32:23.480
Deunan!

01:32:26.970 --> 01:32:30.060
Use this on Xander!

01:32:34.810 --> 01:32:36.940
Go, Deunan!

01:32:37.610 --> 01:32:39.650
You want to die that badly?

01:32:50.830 --> 01:32:51.830
Tereus!

01:32:53.000 --> 01:32:57.920
Xander, you and me...
we're both artificially produced people...

01:32:57.920 --> 01:32:59.250
But...

01:33:00.170 --> 01:33:05.380
Our hearts aren't anyone else's! Your heart is your own!

01:33:05.380 --> 01:33:08.550
Reclaim your true self, Xander!

01:33:38.960 --> 01:33:40.250
Deunan...

01:33:43.170 --> 01:33:46.970
I reset all of Halcon's signals...

01:33:48.510 --> 01:33:49.760
Xander!

01:33:49.760 --> 01:33:51.640
You're the real Xander, aren't you?

01:33:52.350 --> 01:33:58.520
Destroy me while you still can,
and completely stop Halcon's systems.

01:34:00.810 --> 01:34:04.650
Before the machine takes control of me again...

01:34:06.070 --> 01:34:07.450
Hurry!

01:34:10.990 --> 01:34:12.780
Shoot her, Deunan!

01:34:37.020 --> 01:34:38.440
Xander...

01:34:42.610 --> 01:34:47.320
Now... I can die as a human being...

01:34:52.570 --> 01:34:55.120
Thank you...

01:34:55.120 --> 01:34:59.620
I'm sorry...

01:35:32.860 --> 01:35:34.370
This is Section J-4.

01:35:34.370 --> 01:35:38.000
The rioters who were heading towards Tartaros have started collapsing!

01:35:38.000 --> 01:35:39.750
They have stopped moving!

01:35:44.000 --> 01:35:46.340
The abnormal radio waves have ceased!

01:35:46.340 --> 01:35:48.840
We've regained control of the satellite network, too!

01:35:48.840 --> 01:35:51.010
The rioters appear to have collapsed.

01:35:51.010 --> 01:35:52.880
What's going on?

01:35:53.720 --> 01:35:55.760
Have we been saved?

01:36:00.270 --> 01:36:02.560
Are you okay, Briareos?

01:36:02.560 --> 01:36:05.150
I'm all right, Deunan.

01:36:05.860 --> 01:36:08.150
You're really all better now, right?

01:36:10.070 --> 01:36:12.240
Well, looks like I wasn't able to become one with it, huh?

01:36:16.280 --> 01:36:17.370
Tereus!

01:36:19.790 --> 01:36:21.040
Hang in there!

01:36:28.750 --> 01:36:29.710
Let's hurry!

01:36:51.740 --> 01:36:53.200
Where are Arges and the others?

01:36:54.360 --> 01:36:55.200
It's going to crumble!

01:37:02.370 --> 01:37:03.330
Tereus!

01:37:05.210 --> 01:37:07.920
It's okay. Just leave me here.

01:37:07.920 --> 01:37:09.800
Don't be ridiculous! We're comrades!

01:37:11.000 --> 01:37:14.130
I'm a bioroid. They can make any number of me...

01:37:14.130 --> 01:37:15.970
That's not true!

01:37:15.970 --> 01:37:18.300
There's no other Tereus!

01:37:18.300 --> 01:37:19.510
You are one of a kind!

01:37:20.600 --> 01:37:22.060
You know that, don't you?

01:37:26.810 --> 01:37:27.810
Arges!

01:37:29.940 --> 01:37:32.030
Hurry! We're out of time!

01:37:32.940 --> 01:37:34.650
Come on, Tereus!

01:37:39.660 --> 01:37:41.370
We can't hold back any longer!

01:37:42.120 --> 01:37:43.830
Let's go!

01:37:51.170 --> 01:37:52.500
We're out of here!

01:38:20.490 --> 01:38:22.280
What happened?

01:38:23.790 --> 01:38:25.370
Where are we?

01:38:26.290 --> 01:38:27.620
Why are we here?

01:38:44.060 --> 01:38:46.600
We must do everything over again.

01:38:47.520 --> 01:38:51.730
But we are all still alive.

01:38:53.860 --> 01:38:57.780
We won't give up.
We will look forward and forge ahead.

01:38:58.820 --> 01:39:01.240
There's still hope!

01:39:16.550 --> 01:39:19.880
Thank you, Deunan.

01:39:22.550 --> 01:39:25.970
I'll protect you, even if the world comes to an end.

01:39:28.060 --> 01:39:30.480
That's my line.

01:39:30.480 --> 01:39:32.480
So you still remember.

01:39:32.480 --> 01:39:33.810
Yeah.

01:39:38.190 --> 01:39:40.030
Are you okay with that?

01:39:40.030 --> 01:39:43.700
Yeah, it's all right.

01:39:43.700 --> 01:39:46.030
I'll find someone to protect, too.

01:39:47.830 --> 01:39:51.250
All right, let's take our guests back to Olympus!

